; GoldDualBasketDCA v52-compatible trade decisions.
; Same visible inputs as v53, with every v53 behavior switch off.
; Two bugfixes stay on because they are not strategy rules and have no
; off switch: server TP prices are fit to the tick grid, and the 1-second
; timer runs even when the dashboard is hidden. Ticket ids are also
; printed in full. None of those change the entry or target rules.
; Load this when a test must be comparable to the shipped v52 build.

